dsh-host-notify README · First-run setup (one minute, once)：Notifications are posted by a tiny signed helper app, **DSH Notifier**, vendored inside the package:

1. When the first notification arrives, macOS may ask _"DSH Notifier" would like to send you notifications_ → click **Allow**;
2. Open **System Settings → Notifications → DSH Notifier** and set the style to **Persistent (持续/Alerts)** so banners stay on screen until dismissed;
3. Mute there if you prefer silence.
